        <a class="ud-depth" href="signal_lab.html"><span class="l-en">Signal Lab</span><span class="l-zh">信号实验室</span></a>
        <a class="ud-depth" href="macro_signals.html"><span class="l-en">Macro signals</span><span class="l-zh">宏观信号</span></a>
        <a class="ud-depth" href="news.html"><span class="l-en">News feed</span><span class="l-zh">新闻流</span></a>
        <a class="ud-depth" href="macro_monetary.html"><span class="l-en">Macro &amp; Monetary hub</span><span class="l-zh">宏观与货币中心</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    {# === Page footer (spec §6) === #}
    <footer class="ud-foot">
      <span class="l-en">Re-drawn nightly. Windows and stances are our read of the evidence, not advice.</span>
      <span class="l-zh">每晚重新校准。窗口与立场是我们对证据的判读，不构成投资建议。</span>
    </footer>

  </div>
</section>
